Baby Panda's Play covers various themes such as life, habits, safety, art, logic and other topics to help kids learn everyday knowledge and exercise their thinking skills through fun Baby Panda games. Check it out!

LIFE SIMULATION
Here kids can go shopping at a supermarket, go surfing at the beach,travel around the world and taste local specialties. Kids can explore the big world and enjoy different lifestyles through different life simulations!

SAFETY HABITS
Baby Panda's Play provides a lot of safety and habit tips for kids. Baby Panda games give kids a chance to practice brushing their teeth, going to the toilet, escaping and saving themselves in a simulated fire. Through such practice, kids gradually develop good living habits and learn to protect themselves.

ART CREATION
There are fun activities like designing makeup for cute cats, making birthday cards for mom, and creating a diamond crown for princess that allow kids to give full play to their design talents and feel the fun of art creation!

LOGIC TRAINING
Logic training is essential in a child's development! Baby Panda's Play is designed with a variety of logic levels, including graphic matching, cube building, and more. There're also detective games that get kids to find clues and help improve their logical thinking skills!

In addition to the Baby Panda Games, a lot of animated videos have been added to Baby Panda's Play: The MeowMi Family, Monster Truck, Sheriff Labrador and other popular cartoons. Open the videos and watch them now!

FEATURES:
- Lots of content for kids: 9 themes and 80+ Baby Panda games for kids to play;
- 800+ episodes of cartoons: The MeowMi Family, Monster Truck, Sheriff Labrador and other cartoons;
- Faster access: no need to download sub-packages to play the games;
- Takes up little memory space on your mobile phone: download size is less than 70M;
- Supports offline mode: play the games anytime and anywhere;
- Completely free: no in-app purchase, no need to subscribe;
- Usage time control: parents can set time limits on use to protect your kids' eyesight;
- Regular update: new games and content will be added every month;
- Lots of new cartoons and mini-games will be available in the future, so please stay tuned!"


